
  Linux Classroom -- Alpine Linux with bash, nano, vim, man and gcc.

  Useful: ls, cd, cat, nano <file>, vim <file>, man <command>, apropos <word>
          gcc hello.c -o hello, doas <cmd>

  On a phone: tap the screen to type, the key bar above the keyboard has
  Esc, Tab, arrows, Home/End, PgUp/PgDn, Ctrl and Alt.
